  "DescIdentified": {
    "type": "cexolocstring",
    "value": {
      "0": "This blade turned back the charge that broke Edoras's gate, lightning leaping from edge to edge as it found rider after rider of the enemy. Its temper holds an edge no whetstone could match, and where it lands the wound is final -- crackling white fire under a clean, cold light. Rohan's finest carried nothing greater into battle."
    }
  },
  "Description": {
    "type": "cexolocstring",
    "value": {
      "0": "Steel polished to a mirror sheen, this blade hums with a faint, crackling energy. The grip is wrapped in worn leather, smoothed by years of a rider's firm grasp."
    }
  },
